	"data": "Hermes Gateway\n\nHermes Agent gateway runs on pi4 (100.107.33.1) at ~/hermes/config.yaml.\n\nConfiguration to prevent API credit burn:\nwatch_all: false\nwatch_domains: []\nwatch_entities: []\n\nCritical operational note: Gateway does NOT hot-reload config changes. Must restart the service (pkill -f hermes or add-on restart) for config updates to take effect.\n\nArchitecture:\nGateway platform: Subscribes to HA WebSocket state changes, forwards to LLM (costs credits continuously)\nConversation agent: Only…",
